## 1. GRANT OF LICENSE

Subject to your strict compliance with all terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement, the **Cobalt Development Team** ("Licensor") grants you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable personal license to download, install, and execute the Cobalt application solely on Windows operating systems authenticated via designated hardware identification (HWID) systems.

* **Scope of Permitted Use:** Personal, non-commercial execution of approved scripts.
* **Exclusivity:** This license is granted strictly to you as an individual user and cannot be assigned, transferred, or shared.

---

## 2. COMPREHENSIVE RESTRICTIONS & PROHIBITED CONDUCT

You explicitly agree that you shall **NOT**, under any circumstances, directly or indirectly perform, facilitate, or assist in any of the following restricted actions:

### 🚫 Prohibited Actions Matrix

| Category | Forbidden Action | Consequence |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Code Theft & Reverse Engineering** | Decompiling, dumping memory, disassembling, de-obfuscating, hooking, or extracting source code/bytecode. | **Immediate Permanent HWID Blacklist** |
| **Unlawful Redistribution** | Selling, reselling, re-hosting, leaking, sharing, or sublicensing `.exe` binaries, loaders, or access keys. | **Key Termination & Public Blacklist** |
| **Security Tampering** | Bypassing anti-tamper, spoofing hardware signatures, stripping protection layers, or sniffing network API payloads. | **Automated Account Revocation** |
| **Plagiarism & Rebranding** | Modifying user interfaces, logos, or metadata to claim authorship or co-ownership of the Cobalt framework. | **Immediate Permanent Blacklist** |

