* **Licensor Retained Rights:** The Software is licensed, **NOT SOLD**. All title, copyright, trade secrets, patents, UI designs, brand assets, C++ core components, and Luau execution modules remain the exclusive intellectual property of the Cobalt Development Team.
* **No Implied Rights:** Nothing in this Agreement shall be construed as conferring any ownership rights, claims, or title to the underlying source code or system architecture.

